{"term": {"label": "禮", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i", "title": "離婁上", "description": "孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方", "occurrences": 8, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "上", "id": "上"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "出", "id": "出"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "實", "id": "實"}, {"form": "居", "id": "居"}, {"form": "從", "id": "從"}, {"form": "戰", "id": "戰"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "暴", "id": "暴"}, {"form": "服", "id": "服"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "獲", "id": "獲"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.8381033293504077, "source": "戰", "target": "上"}, {"weight": 4.629862798578463, "source": "戰", "target": "服"}, {"weight": 2.9716347219749304, "source": "出", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 2.6839526495231496, "source": "居", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.9409833444645266, "source": "人", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 0.3813675565291038, "source": "人", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.3813675565291038, "source": "人", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 2.1449561487904627, "source": "上", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 3.531250509910353, "source": "上", "target": "獲"}, {"weight": 3.531250509910353, "source": "上", "target": "服"}, {"weight": 3.0204248861443626, "source": "從", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 2.6839526495231496, "source": "從", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.9908054689632042, "source": "禮", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.9908054689632042, "source": "禮", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 2.327277705584417, "source": "禮", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 2.6839526495231496, "source": "君子", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.4311896810277815, "source": "義", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.7676619176489945, "source": "義", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 2.6839526495231496, "source": "言", 